  "notes": "The simplest thing in the collection, on purpose: one axis, one ramp along it, and a single field allowed a whisper of a say. Everything that makes it a sky is in the CURVE above the horizon, so the ramp stops are doing all the work \u2014 this is the gradient where palette choice matters most and effect knobs matter least. The safest asset here to put text on."
